{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 16:11:49.826263", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network appears to be experiencing significant reachability issues. Based on the ping results, all tested connections between hosts (clients, DNS servers, and web servers) are marked as \"unknown,\" indicating that no successful communication or response was observed. This suggests a widespread anomaly affecting the network\\'s ability to route traffic or establish connectivity.\\n\\n#### Findings:\\n1. **Reachability Issues**:\\n   - All ping tests between the hosts (clients, DNS servers, and web servers) failed to produce any results. This includes connections from:\\n     - `client_0` and `client_1` to web servers (`webserver2_pod1`, `webserver0_pod1`).\\n     - DNS servers (`dns_pod0`, `dns_pod1`) to web servers.\\n     - Web servers within the same pod and across pods.\\n   - The status for all tests is \"unknown,\" with no transmitted (`tx`) or received (`rx`) packets, and no RTT (Round Trip Time) metrics available.\\n\\n2. **Potential Scope of the Issue**:\\n   - The issue seems to affect the entire network, as no host-to-host communication is successful. This could point to a systemic problem such as:\\n     - Routing misconfigurations.\\n     - BGP session failures.\\n     - Link or interface failures across the Clos fabric.\\n\\n3. **Impact**:\\n   - External clients (`client_0` and `client_1`) are unable to access web services hosted in the pods.\\n   - DNS servers cannot communicate with web servers, potentially disrupting name resolution services.\\n   - Inter-pod communication between web servers is also non-functional.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nTo further diagnose the root cause, the following areas should be investigated:\\n1. **Router Configurations**:\\n   - Verify BGP session states and routing tables on all routers (leaf, spine, and super-spine).\\n   - Check for any misconfigurations or anomalies in the advertised routes.\\n\\n2. **Interface and Link Status**:\\n   - Inspect the status of interfaces and links across the network to identify any physical or logical failures.\\n\\n3. **Host-Level Diagnostics**:\\n   - Examine the network configurations and service statuses on individual hosts (clients, DNS servers, and web servers).\\n\\n4. **Traffic Analysis**:\\n   - Analyze traffic statistics and counters on switches and routers to detect packet drops or congestion.\\n\\nThis report highlights the widespread connectivity issues and provides a direction for further investigation to pinpoint the root cause., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='1ba94029-b077-4929-8fc3-dd1aa4cc58b7'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
